OL,3,GNEWSATeddy bear hunt to promote
OL,4,Abenefits of fostering
OL,5,
OL,6,FTeddy bears have been placed in
OL,7,FGuernsey businesses for people to find
OL,8,Fin a bid to promote the benefits of
OL,9,Ffostering children.
OL,11,FThe Family Placement Service has 15
OL,12,Fbears in locations across the island as
OL,13,Fpart of its Hidden Bears Hidden Heroes
OL,14,Finitiative which starts on Saturday.
OL,16,FEach one is carrying a card with their
OL,17,Findividual story and information about
OL,18,Ffostering which people are encouraged
OL,19,Fto find and share a photo of.
