OL,3,GNEWSATeddy bear hunt to promote
OL,4,Abenefits of fostering
OL,5,
OL,6,FVicky Tellen from the service said the
OL,7,Fproject aimed to promote the impact
OL,8,Ffoster carers can have on young
OL,9,Fpeoples' lives.
